            "detailed_description": "Fly O’Clock is tiny, highly-addictive single &amp; online multiplayer arcade endless jumper with innovative one-touch mechanics and unique pixel-art graphics.<br />\r\nThe faster you play the more you risk and as you know: no risk no fun.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCheck how long you will survive on the clock face, avoid the clock hands and jump between 4 points as fast as you can to reach the top of the leaderboards.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUnlock all the characters, watches and hats! Style your favorite insect with unique hat!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- online multiplayer exclusively on Steam<br />\r\n- 16+ characters to unlock<br />\r\n- 5+ watches to jump on<br />\r\n- 15+ hats to try on<br />\r\n- ultimate Rock &amp; Roll soundtrack!<br />\r\n- one-touch controls<br />\r\n- brand new jumpy gameplay",
            "about_the_game": "Fly O’Clock is tiny, highly-addictive single &amp; online multiplayer arcade endless jumper with innovative one-touch mechanics and unique pixel-art graphics.<br />\r\nThe faster you play the more you risk and as you know: no risk no fun.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCheck how long you will survive on the clock face, avoid the clock hands and jump between 4 points as fast as you can to reach the top of the leaderboards.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUnlock all the characters, watches and hats! Style your favorite insect with unique hat!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- online multiplayer exclusively on Steam<br />\r\n- 16+ characters to unlock<br />\r\n- 5+ watches to jump on<br />\r\n- 15+ hats to try on<br />\r\n- ultimate Rock &amp; Roll soundtrack!<br />\r\n- one-touch controls<br />\r\n- brand new jumpy gameplay",
